# ENDEVIS Design System (authoritative)

The ENDEVIS invoice document is the **Design System** of the application. Every
new page, dialog, form, table, PDF and document MUST follow the same spacing,
typography, colors, icons and visual language. **Never introduce a different
style.**

## Colors (use CSS variables, never hard-coded hex in components)
- Primary — Gold `#C89B3C` (`--gold` / `--primary`, Tailwind `primary`/`gold`)
- Secondary — Graphite `#181818` (`--graphite` / `--secondary`)
- Background — White `#FFFFFF` (`--background`)
- Surface — Light Gray `#F7F7F7` (`--muted`)
- Text — Dark Gray (`--foreground` / `--muted-foreground`)
- The **Grand Total** and primary actions are always highlighted in Gold.

## Typography
- Font: **Inter** (`--font-sans`). Headings bold, body regular.
- Generous, consistent spacing. Modern, minimal, premium (Apple + Stripe + Linear).

## Icons
- **Lucide** icons only. **Outline** style only. No colorful icons.
- Same icon size and spacing everywhere (`h-4 w-4` in dense UI, `h-5 w-5` for emphasis).

## Radius & surfaces
- Radius 16px (`--radius`, Tailwind `rounded-lg`). Use `Card` + `card-elevated` for panels.

## Documents (Invoice, Advance/Proforma Invoice, Credit Note, Quotation, Budget,
## Customer/Supplier Order, Delivery Note, Acceptance Protocol, Service Report)
All documents share ONE print engine (`src/components/pdf/document-pdf.tsx`,
React PDF). The in-app preview embeds the generated PDF, so preview = print =
exported file are byte-for-byte identical. Page = A4, fixed 8mm margins, absolute
mm layout; only the items table grows. The company logo is uploaded in Settings
and injected globally into the header. MUST keep an identical visual identity:
1. Header: ENDEVIS logo + gold icon + slogan (left); large Czech document title +
   number/issue/due/tax dates (right).
2. Parties: Dodavatel (left) / Odběratel (right) — Company, Address, IČO, DIČ,
   Email, Phone, Website.
3. Information bar: outline Lucide icons (number, currency, VS, payment method,
   due date, …) — identical icon style across all documents.
4. Items table: dark header, white rows, thin borders — columns Popis, Množství,
   MJ, Cena/j., DPH, Sleva, Celkem.
5. Totals: Mezisoučet, DPH, Sleva, Doprava, **Celkem k úhradě** (highlighted gold).
6. Payment card: IBAN, SWIFT, Banka, QR platba, Variabilní symbol, Způsob platby,
   Splatnost.
7. Footer: Address, Email, Website, Phone, IČO, DIČ, legal information.

## PDF
- Every document renders a professional **A4** PDF with identical margins, no page
  overflow, perfect printing. Documents also render responsively (desktop/tablet/
  mobile) in-app; the PDF always remains A4.

## Language
- The entire application UI is in **Czech**. Translate all new strings.
